{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18301130","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18301130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1830113001:1":{"text":"살아 있을 때도 예뻤으니까, 그레이브본이 되면 분명 색다른 아름다움을 보여주겠지.","source_cn":"塞涅小姐生前就那么漂亮，变成亡灵肯定有一种别样的美丽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8690D6F1A8D9CF91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1830113002:1":{"text":"이제 막 그레이브본이 된 거니까, 크게 다르진 않을 것 같아.","source_cn":"我认为塞涅刚成为亡灵，我感觉不会有太大的变化。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x075C9FABE131B049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1830113003:1":{"text":"아마 우리처럼 두 눈이 빛나지 않을까?","source_cn":"应该就跟我们现在一样，双眼发光吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF905E0368900FC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1830113004:1":{"text":"눈이 빛나는 건 확실하지. 여기 사람들 봐, 다들 눈이 빛나잖아.","source_cn":"双眼发光是肯定的，你们看这里的人都是双眼发光的呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x807EC4F34517245B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1830113005:1":{"text":"으으, 자세히 보니까 좀 무섭다...","source_cn":"咦惹，细看有点吓人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA916782FE042C357","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1830113006:1":{"text":"폴리, 이거 봐라. 어흥~!","source_cn":"波莉，看着我……嗷嗷嗷——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39B150930C25A580","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1830113007:1":{"text":"으악! 깜짝 놀랐잖아. 조스아, 그러지 마!","source_cn":"啊！吓死人了乔舒亚！不要这样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89AD265C10903CE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1830113008:1":{"text":"하하하하, 그렇게 겁이 많으면서 용캐도 우리를 따라 여기까지 왔네.","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈，这么胆小还跟着我们跑过来。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD366FA1E4469D412","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"하하하하, 그렇게 겁이 많으면서 용캐도 우리를 따라 여기까지 왔네.","female":"하하하하, 그렇게 겁이 많으면서 용캐도 우리를 따라 여기까지 왔네.","variant_male_record_index":"246690","variant_female_record_index":"246691","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1830113009:1":{"text":"세니아 보려고 온 거잖아...!","source_cn":"那还不都是为了见塞涅……！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8B154096807621BD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"세니아 보려고 온 거잖아...!","female":"세니아 보려고 온 거잖아...!","variant_male_record_index":"246693","variant_female_record_index":"246694","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:波莉":{"text":"폴리","source":"波莉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:乔舒亚":{"text":"조스아","source":"乔舒亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:西德尼<key:dialog8>":{"text":"시드니","source":"西德尼<key:dialog8>","status":"matched_dialogue_